## Contributing

Run `cargo fmt --all`, `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings` and `cargo test --workspace` before opening a pull request. Commits follow Conventional Commits and releases are cut by release-please. The README is generated: edit `README.md.j2` or `readme.yaml`, then run `readwright render`.
